      "writtenOn": "2025-09-04T07:10:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Misleading Variable Names: The variable names end with Ms (milliseconds), but the calculation (tv.tv_sec*1e6*1ll + tv.tv_usec*1ll) stores time in microseconds. This is confusing and error-prone.\n\nFix: Rename the variables to reflect their actual units, for example, proc_start_timestamp_us.",
      "revId": "382404c25bbc609d8a9e550da06012b3f8d3e175",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
